These issues to be determined by the Tribunal to arrive at the loss of dependency are: (i) additions/deductions to be made for arriving at the Smt.Kalpana (Wife/Widow Of Deceased) vs Shri Bablu Kumar Yadav on 15 February, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/114524202/
7 income;
(ii) the deduction to be made towards the personal living expenses of the deceased; and (iii) the multiplier to be applied with reference to the age of the deceased.
